  ],
  "confirmedGap": "Existing progressRules setting/core were present, but purchase-order entry Option lacked the documented entry into the settings editor.",
  "implemented": [
    "Reuse existing SelfSettingsUI progress editor through purchase-order input Option; scope list to plan→purchaseorder.",
    "Missing rule is shown as change-disabled without creating it; only explicit config.save writes inventoryFeatures through existing server revision CAS.",
    "Preserve the unsaved parent values and local business raw; require config.write/inventory.read, unchanged identity/company/role/settings and connected parent route/draft/storage.",
    "Close/navigation/disposal blocks deferred initialization and stale save handlers; failed save retains the setting draft.",
    "Read back explicit saves and refresh only supported client setting keys; existing unrelated rules/import settings/config sections and saved forms remain intact."
  ],
  "scopeLimits": [
    "Existing plan model changes only actually allocated plan rows; this patch does not change plan container/other-line status, amounts or core schema. Official partial/multiline/grouped automatic-completion and company-specific permission contracts remain unverified.",
